sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant S as Service
    participant L as Split / Ledger logic
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>UI: Fill in expense form, click Add
    UI->>API: POST /api/groups/1/expenses (JSON)
    API->>API: Parse JSON, check size limit
    API->>S: addExpense(groupId, body)
    S->>DB: Load group and members
    S->>S: Validate description, payer, category, participants
    S->>L: toMinor(amount), computeSplit(type, total, input)
    L-->>S: Shares in paise (always sums to total)
    S->>DB: BEGIN, insert expense and splits, COMMIT
    S-->>API: Saved expense
    API-->>UI: 201 Created (JSON)
    UI->>API: GET /api/groups/1/balances
    API->>S: getBalances(groupId)
    S->>L: calculateBalances, simplifyDebts
    L-->>S: Net balances and payment list
    S-->>API: Balances JSON
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
    UI-->>U: Updated balances and "who pays whom"
